<rml>
<head>
    <title>VIXEN Editor</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="editor.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
    <div data-model="editor_layers" id="panel">
        <div class="title">Rule layers</div>
        <!-- Inc-A2 (View-Model-Binding-Inc-A2-Plan-2026-07.md): layer rows are now data-model-bound,
             replacing the Inc1 static markup (3 hand-authored "checkbox checked" divs). Each row's
             id (row.elementId, "layer-<index>-toggle" -- built once in EditorLayersView::
             PopulateFromMask, not re-derived here via string concat) still carries hit-mask="none"
             so UISelectionProviderNode's click hit-test resolves it and EditorApplication::Update
             drains the id via DrainClickedElementId and dispatches it through AppFlowRuntime::
             DispatchBySelector (Inc-4 reframe R5 — the editor names no action verbs). row.isChecked
             drives the "checked" class the same way hud.rml's data-class-focused et al. do. -->
        <div class="row" data-for="row : layers">
            <div data-attr-id="row.elementId" class="checkbox" data-class-checked="row.isChecked" hit-mask="none"></div>
            <span class="col-name">{{row.name}}</span>
            <span class="col-op">{{row.op}}</span>
            <div class="button" data-attr-id="row.moveUpId" hit-mask="none">↑</div>
            <div class="button" data-attr-id="row.moveDownId" hit-mask="none">↓</div>
            <div class="button" data-attr-id="row.deleteId" hit-mask="none">×</div>
            <div class="program-controls">
                <span class="value">instruction 0 · data 0: {{row.programFieldValue}}</span>
                <div class="button" data-attr-id="row.programDownId" hit-mask="none">−</div>
                <div class="button" data-attr-id="row.programUpId" hit-mask="none">+</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="toolbar">
            <div class="button" id="add-layer" hit-mask="none">Add rule layer</div>
            <div class="button" id="undo-button" hit-mask="none">Undo</div>
            <div class="button" id="redo-button" hit-mask="none">Redo</div>
            <div class="button" id="save-button" hit-mask="none">Save</div>
        </div>
        <div class="title parameters-title">Recipe parameters</div>
        <div class="parameter-row" data-for="param : parameters">
            <span class="parameter-name">{{param.name}}</span>
            <span class="parameter-value">{{param.value}} {{param.unit}}</span>
            <div class="button" data-attr-id="param.downId" hit-mask="none">−</div>
            <div class="button" data-attr-id="param.upId" hit-mask="none">+</div>
            <span class="parameter-range">{{param.minimum}}–{{param.maximum}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hint">Click a box to toggle a layer. Edits support undo/redo. S saves.</div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
